<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 15.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Jan 15.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Consol Rutile	 180.00    0.90</p>
<p> 2   Telecasters Nqld     15.36    5.21</p>
<p> 3   Hills Inds	     15.29    1.70</p>
<p> 4   Schroder Intl	  10.46    2.30</p>
